{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1445727-does-road-aura-modifiers-from-merits-stack","id":1445727,"title":"Does Road aura modifiers from merits stack?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-24T16:15:24-07:00","id":1445727,"title":"Does Road aura modifiers from merits stack?","content":"Hello everyone.<br /> <br /> As the subject reads, but of course a bit of clarification is in order.<br /> So Dark Ages Potent Aura (3-point merit) improves when the reduction to difficulty happens, and the amount in reduction depends on the kindred's road rating, but there is at least one other merit that does the EXACT same thing mechanically, but just has a different description; Innocent (2-point merit) from Road of Sin source book. I would assume they stack, but I might have missed a rule with regards to this, but I haven't been able to find anything in regards to it. In the case that they do, what other merits would stack with it?<br /> <br /> Thank you.<br /> <br /> //Inc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24617,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24617-incarnate","user":"Incarnate","date":". 04-24-2021, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24617-incarnate","name":"Incarnate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-24T16:31:33-07:00","id":1445733,"title":"","content":"Well, in practical terms it will depend on the Storyteller, as I don't think there are any specific rules governing this. As a general rule, Merits and Flaws do stack, but this is a special instance, as the wording of Innocent implies is completely supersedes the Aura rules and modifiers that a character should possess. Innocent isn't a great Merit to purchase in some senses, as it is hard to keep one's Road rating where one would benefit, and easier to end up where one gets penalties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}